---
import '../styles/reference-home.css';
import '../styles/site-pages.css';
const products = [
  { name: 'Timenox', description: 'Attendance & Workforce Management', color: 'blue', icon: 'T', href: '/products/timenox/' },
  { name: 'Timenox 360', description: 'Field Staff Tracking & Operations', color: 'teal', icon: 'pin', href: '/products/timenox-360/' },
  { name: 'Vyfoo', description: 'Restaurant POS & Management', color: 'orange', icon: 'chef', href: '/products/vyfoo/' },
  { name: 'VYQDA Retail', description: 'Retail Billing & Inventory', color: 'purple', icon: 'bag', href: '/products/retail/' },
  { name: 'SHYFT Box Finder', description: 'Smart Parcel & Box Finding Solution', color: 'navy', icon: 'cap', href: '/products/shyft-box-finder/' },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#fffaf6" />
  <title>VYQDA Technologies | Software Products & Custom Development</title>
  <meta name="description" content="VYQDA Technologies builds software products and delivers custom technology solutions that help businesses operate efficiently, solve real problems and grow with confidence." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://vyqda.com/" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index,follow,max-image-preview:large" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="VYQDA Technologies" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="VYQDA Technologies | Software Products & Custom Development" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Software products, custom software development, business automation and long-term technology support." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="VYQDA Technologies | Technology that helps businesses do more" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Software products, custom development and long-term technology partnership." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://vyqda.com/" />
  <script type="application/ld+json">{JSON.stringify({ '@context':'https://schema.org', '@graph':[
    { '@type':'Organization', '@id':'https://vyqda.com/#organization', name:'VYQDA Technologies Pvt. Ltd.', url:'https://vyqda.com/', description:'Software products, custom software development, business automation, and long-term technology solutions for businesses.', areaServed:['India','United States','United Arab Emirates','Australia'], knowsAbout:['Custom Software Development','SaaS Product Development','Web Application Development','Mobile Application Development','Business Process Automation','Workforce Management Software','Restaurant POS Software','Retail Billing Software'] },
    { '@type':'WebSite', '@id':'https://vyqda.com/#website', url:'https://vyqda.com/', name:'VYQDA Technologies', publisher:{'@id':'https://vyqda.com/#organization'}, inLanguage:'en' },
    { '@type':'FAQPage', '@id':'https://vyqda.com/#faq', mainEntity:[
      { '@type':'Question', name:'What does VYQDA Technologies do?', acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer', text:'VYQDA Technologies develops software products and provides custom software development and technology services for businesses, including web applications, SaaS product engineering, business automation, workforce tools and operational software.'}},
      { '@type':'Question', name:'Does VYQDA build custom software for businesses?', acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer', text:'Custom projects can be scoped around business workflows, user needs, integrations and technical constraints. Start with a discussion of the problem, desired outcome, scope and timeline.'}},
      { '@type':'Question', name:'Can VYQDA support an existing application after launch?', acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer', text:'Ongoing work may include maintenance, bug fixes, technical improvements, new features and continued development. The support arrangement depends on the application and agreed requirements.'}},
      { '@type':'Question', name:'Does VYQDA offer ready-made software products?', acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer', text:'VYQDA’s product portfolio includes Timenox for attendance and workforce management, Timenox 360 for field operations, Vyfoo for restaurant POS workflows, VYQDA Retail for retail operations and SHYFT Box Finder.'}},
      { '@type':'Question', name:'How do we start a software project with VYQDA?', acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer', text:'Share a description of your business, the problem to solve, intended users, timeline and integration requirements. This helps establish whether a product, tailored solution or phased approach is the right fit.'}},
      { '@type':'Question', name:'How much does custom software development cost?', acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer', text:'Cost depends on scope, integrations, complexity, delivery stages and ongoing support needs. A useful estimate starts with requirements and priorities.'}}
    ]}
  ] })}</script>
</head>
<body id="top">
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar__inner wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="VYQDA Technologies home">
        <img class="brand__logo" src="https://etl8nmt6drqkbvcf.private.blob.vercel-storage.com/vyqda-logo-20qGY8TREezFR3V8YLocLvV6ihwupO.png?vercel-blob-delegation=eyJzdG9yZUlkIjoic3RvcmVfZVRMOE5NdDZkclFrQnZjRiIsIm93bmVySWQiOiJ0ZWFtX1NRTlk1amJjdVVvSDIyVnkwNEx5eDV5OCIsInBhdGhuYW1lIjoiKiIsIm9wZXJhdGlvbnMiOlsiZ2V0IiwiaGVhZCJdLCJ2YWxpZFVudGlsIjoxNzkyNTY1MTYxNzM4LCJpYXQiOjE3OTI1MjE5NjE4ODZ9.yMipf01FqJtedjo9KHZU7UVAdmdNb13CfBV7lfhgeTc&vercel-blob-signature=QvSbHdS3Yj7sesjrRogRbjsdCl8fVN26QoQJp5URg-0" alt="VYQDA Technologies" />
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a class="nav__link" href="/products/">Products</a>
        <a class="nav__link" href="/services/">Development Services</a>
        <a class="nav__link" href="/solutions/">Solutions</a>
        <a class="nav__link" href="/industries/">Industries</a>
        <a class="nav__link" href="/about/">Company</a>
        <a class="nav__link" href="/faq/">FAQs</a><a class="nav__link" href="/tools/">Free Tools</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="topbar__actions">
        
        <a class="contact" href="#contact">Contact Us <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 10h13M10 4l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        <button class="menu-toggle" type="button" data-menu-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav" aria-label="Open navigation menu"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18"/></svg></button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="mobile-nav wrap" id="mobile-nav" data-mobile-nav hidden aria-label="Mobile navigation"><a href="/products/">Products</a><a href="/services/">Development Services</a><a href="/solutions/">Solutions</a><a href="/industries/">Industries</a><a href="/about/">Company</a><a href="/faq/">FAQs</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero__ring hero__ring--outer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero__ring hero__ring--middle" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero__ring hero__ring--inner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot--one" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot--two" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot--three" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot--four" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot--five" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="orbit-dot orbit-dot--six" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <div class="capability capability--left capability--one"><span class="capability__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m11 9-7 7 7 7M21 9l7 7-7 7M19 5l-6 22"/></svg></span><span><strong>Custom<br/>Development</strong><small>Web, Mobile &amp; Cloud</small></span></div>
      <div class="capability capability--left capability--two"><span class="capability__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="16" cy="8" rx="10" ry="4"/><path d="M6 8v15c0 2.2 4.5 4 10 4s10-1.8 10-4V8M6 13c0 2.2 4.5 4 10 4s10-1.8 10-4M6 18c0 2.2 4.5 4 10 4s10-1.8 10-4"/></svg></span><span><strong>Business<br/>Automation</strong><small>Streamline Operations</small></span></div>
      <div class="capability capability--left capability--three"><span class="capability__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 22a7 7 0 0 1 1-14 9 9 0 0 1 17 3 6 6 0 0 1 0 12H7Z"/></svg></span><span><strong>Scalable<br/>Solutions</strong><small>Built for Growth</small></span></div>
      <div class="capability capability--right capability--one"><span class="capability__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="5" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="19" y="5" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="5" y="19" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/><rect x="19" y="19" width="8" height="8" rx="1.5"/></svg></span><span><strong>Software<br/>Products</strong><small>Real Business Impact</small></span></div>
      <div class="capability capability--right capability--two"><span class="capability__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 4 27 8v8c0 7-5 11-11 14C10 27 5 23 5 16V8l11-4Z"/></svg></span><span><strong>Reliable<br/>Partnership</strong><small>Long-Term Support</small></span></div>
      <div class="capability capability--right capability--three"><span class="capability__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 26V17M12 26V12M19 26V6M26 26V3M4 12l8-5 7 2 8-7"/><path d="m22 3 5-1v5"/></svg></span><span><strong>Engineering<br/>Excellence</strong><small>Quality. Accountability.</small></span></div>
      <div class="hero__content">
        <p class="eyebrow">SOFTWARE PRODUCTS <span>·</span> CUSTOM DEVELOPMENT <span>·</span> LONG-TERM PARTNERSHIP</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Technology<br/>that helps businesses<br/><em>do more.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero__summary">VYQDA Technologies builds software products and delivers custom<br/> technology solutions that help businesses operate efficiently,<br/> solve real problems and grow with confidence.</p>
        <div class="hero__buttons">
          <a class="button button--primary" href="#products">Explore Our Products <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 10h15M11 4l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          <a class="button button--secondary" href="#contact">Discuss Your Project</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="products" id="products" aria-labelledby="products-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="products__heading">
          <div><p class="products__eyebrow">OUR SOFTWARE PRODUCTS</p><h2 id="products-title">Powerful products for real business needs.</h2></div>
          <a class="products__all" href="/products/">Explore Product Suite <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 10h15M11 4l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="product-grid" id="product-suite">
          {products.map(product => <a class="product-card" href={product.href}>
            <span class:list={['product-card__icon', `product-card__icon--${product.color}`]} aria-hidden="true">
              {product.icon === 'T' ? 'T' : product.icon === 'pin' ? <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M26 13c0 7-10 16-10 16S6 20 6 13a10 10 0 1 1 20 0Z"/><circle cx="16" cy="13" r="3"/></svg> : product.icon === 'chef' ? <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M8 16h16v12H8zM6 16a5 5 0 0 1 1-10 6 6 0 0 1 11-1 6 6 0 0 1 10 5 5 5 0 0 1-2 6"/></svg> : product.icon === 'bag' ? <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="M5 11h22l-2 17H7L5 11Z"/><path d="M11 11V8a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3M16 16v7"/></svg> : <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32"><path d="m3 12 13-7 13 7-13 7-13-7Z"/><path d="M8 15v8l8 4 8-4v-8"/></svg>}
            </span>
            <span class="product-card__copy"><strong>{product.name}</strong><small>{product.description}</small></span>
            <span class="product-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M2 10h15M11 4l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
          </a>)}
        </div>
        <div class="trust-strip" aria-label="Industries served">
          <span class="trust-strip__label">TRUSTED BY BUSINESSES IN</span>
          <span class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 20V11l5 3V8l5 3V5l8-3v18H3Z"/><path d="M7 20v-3M12 20v-3M17 20v-3"/></svg>Manufacturing</span>
          <span class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 4h2l2 12h11l3-9H6"/><circle cx="9" cy="20" r="1.5"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="1.5"/></svg>Retail</span>
          <span class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 3v7M8 3v7M4 7h4M6 10v11M15 3c-3 4-3 8 0 10v8M15 13h5V3"/></svg>Restaurants</span>
          <span class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s-9-5.5-9-12a5 5 0 0 1 9-3 5 5 0 0 1 9 3c0 6.5-9 12-9 12Z"/><path d="M7 12h3l2-3 2 6 2-3h2"/></svg>Healthcare</span>
          <span class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m3 9 9-5 9 5-9 5-9-5Z"/><path d="M6 12v5c4 3 8 3 12 0v-5M21 9v7"/></svg>Education</span>
          <span class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 21V8h7v13M10 21V3h11v18M6 11h1M6 15h1M14 7h2M14 11h2M14 15h2M14 19h2"/></svg>Corporate Offices</span>
          <span class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 20V11l5 3V8l5 3V5l8-3v18H3Z"/></svg>Construction</span>
          <span class="trust-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg>and more...</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro-section section-pad" id="company" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
      <div class="wrap intro-grid">
        <div class="section-kicker"><span class="kicker-line"></span> A TECHNOLOGY PARTNER, NOT JUST A VENDOR</div>
        <div class="intro-copy">
          <h2 id="intro-title">Software built around <em>the way your business works.</em></h2>
          <p class="lead">VYQDA Technologies is a software product and technology company helping businesses solve operational challenges with practical software, thoughtful engineering and dependable ongoing support.</p>
          <p>Some businesses need a ready-to-use product. Others need a tailored application, a connected workflow or a technology partner who can stay involved after launch. We bring product thinking and custom development together to help teams work more clearly, reduce manual effort and build for what comes next.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="#contact">Talk through your requirements <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-section section-pad" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <div><p class="section-kicker">WHAT WE DO</p><h2 id="services-title">From first idea to <em>long-term improvement.</em></h2></div>
          <p>Clear scope, considered engineering and practical decisions—across the full software lifecycle.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-grid">
          <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">01</span><div class="service-symbol">⌘</div><h3>Custom Software Development</h3><p>Purpose-built business applications shaped around your workflows, users, integrations and operational needs.</p><a href="#contact">Discuss a custom build <span>↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">02</span><div class="service-symbol">◫</div><h3>SaaS &amp; Product Engineering</h3><p>From product validation and MVP planning to feature development, platform improvements and ongoing releases.</p><a href="#contact">Plan a product <span>↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">03</span><div class="service-symbol">↗</div><h3>Web &amp; Mobile Applications</h3><p>Responsive digital experiences and application interfaces designed around real user tasks and business outcomes.</p><a href="#contact">Build an application <span>↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">04</span><div class="service-symbol">⤳</div><h3>Business Process Automation</h3><p>Reduce repetitive work by connecting systems, structuring data and improving everyday operational processes.</p><a href="#contact">Explore automation <span>↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">05</span><div class="service-symbol">▦</div><h3>Workforce &amp; Operations Software</h3><p>Practical tools for attendance, workforce visibility, field operations and the reporting that supports better decisions.</p><a href="/products/timenox/">Explore workforce products <span>↗</span></a></article>
          <article class="service-card"><span class="service-number">06</span><div class="service-symbol">↻</div><h3>Maintenance &amp; Ongoing Support</h3><p>Post-launch fixes, enhancements, technical upkeep and continued development as your requirements evolve.</p><a href="#contact">Discuss ongoing support <span>↗</span></a></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="solutions-section section-pad" id="solutions" aria-labelledby="solutions-title">
      <div class="wrap solutions-grid">
        <div class="solutions-intro"><p class="section-kicker">SOLUTIONS FOR REAL OPERATIONS</p><h2 id="solutions-title">Technology should make work <em>simpler, not heavier.</em></h2><p>We focus on the practical details that make software useful: clear workflows, sensible access, reliable information and the ability to adapt as a business grows.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="#contact">Tell Us What You Need <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 10h15M11 4l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
        <div class="solution-list">
          <a href="#product-timenox" class="solution-row"><span class="solution-row__num">01</span><span><strong>Workforce and attendance management</strong><small>Make attendance records, shifts and workforce reporting easier to manage.</small></span><span class="solution-row__arrow">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/products/timenox-360/" class="solution-row"><span class="solution-row__num">02</span><span><strong>Field teams and distributed operations</strong><small>Support field workflows with tools designed for operational visibility.</small></span><span class="solution-row__arrow">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/products/vyfoo/" class="solution-row"><span class="solution-row__num">03</span><span><strong>Restaurant billing and point of sale</strong><small>Bring essential restaurant transactions and management tasks into a more connected workflow.</small></span><span class="solution-row__arrow">↗</span></a>
          <a href="/products/retail/" class="solution-row"><span class="solution-row__num">04</span><span><strong>Retail billing and inventory</strong><small>Support everyday retail operations with focused billing and stock workflows.</small></span><span class="solution-row__arrow">↗</span></a>
          <a href="#contact" class="solution-row"><span class="solution-row__num">05</span><span><strong>Purpose-built business applications</strong><small>Design a software solution around the way your team actually works.</small></span><span class="solution-row__arrow">↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="industries-section section-pad" id="industries" aria-labelledby="industries-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="section-kicker">INDUSTRIES &amp; USE CASES</p><h2 id="industries-title">Built for the work behind <em>every business.</em></h2></div><p>Different sectors have different constraints. The right software starts by understanding the work that needs to get done.</p></div>
        <div class="industry-grid">
          <article class="industry-card"><span>01 / OPERATIONS</span><h3>Manufacturing &amp; industrial teams</h3><p>Attendance, internal workflows, operational reporting and software tailored to site-level needs.</p></article>
          <article class="industry-card"><span>02 / CUSTOMER SERVICE</span><h3>Retail &amp; showrooms</h3><p>Billing, stock-related workflows and connected systems for day-to-day store operations.</p></article>
          <article class="industry-card"><span>03 / HOSPITALITY</span><h3>Restaurants &amp; food businesses</h3><p>Point-of-sale and management tools that help organise routine service operations.</p></article>
          <article class="industry-card"><span>04 / PEOPLE</span><h3>Offices &amp; professional services</h3><p>Workforce records, attendance processes and custom applications for administrative teams.</p></article>
          <article class="industry-card"><span>05 / DISTRIBUTED TEAMS</span><h3>Field services &amp; construction</h3><p>Tools for teams working across locations, projects and changing schedules.</p></article>
          <article class="industry-card"><span>06 / CARE &amp; LEARNING</span><h3>Healthcare &amp; education</h3><p>Workflow software designed around clear records, dependable processes and staff coordination.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="approach-section section-pad" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
      <div class="wrap approach-grid">
        <div><p class="section-kicker">HOW WE WORK</p><h2 id="approach-title">A thoughtful process. <em>No unnecessary complexity.</em></h2><p class="approach-lead">Good software comes from understanding the problem before choosing the technology.</p></div>
        <ol class="approach-steps">
          <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Understand the business</h3><p>Clarify goals, users, constraints, current systems and how success should be measured.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Define a practical plan</h3><p>Agree on scope, priorities, delivery stages and the trade-offs that matter most.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Build and validate</h3><p>Develop in focused stages, test core workflows and review progress against agreed requirements.</p></div></li>
          <li><span>04</span><div><h3>Support what comes next</h3><p>Address issues, improve features and keep the solution aligned with changing business needs.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="principles-section section-pad" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
      <div class="wrap principles-wrap"><p class="section-kicker">WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT</p><h2 id="principles-title">A technology partner built on <em>clarity and accountability.</em></h2>
        <div class="principle-grid"><article><span>↗</span><h3>Business-first thinking</h3><p>Technology choices should serve the business problem—not the other way around.</p></article><article><span>◎</span><h3>Direct communication</h3><p>Clear discussions about scope, decisions, risks and delivery expectations.</p></article><article><span>✓</span><h3>Engineering care</h3><p>Maintainable implementation, sensible testing and attention to real-world use.</p></article><article><span>↻</span><h3>Long-term responsibility</h3><p>Support and improvement matter after launch, not only during development.</p></article></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-section section-pad" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
      <div class="wrap faq-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">COMMON QUESTIONS</p><h2 id="faq-title">Before we <em>get started.</em></h2><p>Every project is different. These answers explain how VYQDA approaches products, custom software and ongoing technology work.</p><a class="text-link" href="#contact">Have another question? Contact us <span>↗</span></a></div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details><summary>What does VYQDA Technologies do?</summary><p>VYQDA Technologies develops software products and provides custom software development and technology services for businesses. Areas of work include web applications, SaaS product engineering, business automation, workforce tools and operational software.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Does VYQDA build custom software for businesses?</summary><p>Yes. Custom projects can be scoped around your business workflows, user needs, integrations and technical constraints. The best starting point is a conversation about the problem, desired outcome, scope and timeline.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Can you support an existing application after launch?</summary><p>Ongoing work may include maintenance, bug fixes, technical improvements, new features and continued development. The support arrangement depends on the application and the requirements agreed for the engagement.</p></details>
          <details><summary>Does VYQDA offer ready-made software products?</summary><p>VYQDA's product portfolio includes Timenox for attendance and workforce management, Timenox 360 for field operations, Vyfoo for restaurant POS workflows, VYQDA Retail for retail operations and SHYFT Box Finder. Product scope and availability should be confirmed for your use case.</p></details>
          <details><summary>How do we start a software project with VYQDA?</summary><p>Share a short description of your business, the problem you want to solve, the people who will use the software and any timeline or integration requirements. That helps establish whether a product, a tailored solution or a phased approach is the right fit.</p></details>
          <details><summary>How much does custom software development cost?</summary><p>Cost depends on scope, integrations, complexity, delivery stages and ongoing support needs. A useful estimate starts with requirements and priorities rather than a generic price that may not fit the project.</p></details>
        </div>
      </div>
